/* The reserved hint NOPs: the CPU runs every 0F 19-1F encoding as a NOP (tools/ia32-cpu-decode-check.sh);
 * LLVM decodes only some of them. ENDBR32 is F3 0F 1E FB, a NOP where CET is off. */
