/* Descriptor-table stores: user-mode instructions a CPU with CR4.UMIP faults (#GP(0)) and the console's kernel
 * leaves to the program; src/pw_umip.h emulates them. SGDT/SIDT store a 16-bit limit and a base of 4 bytes (8 in
 * long mode); SLDT, STR and SMSW store a word in memory, or the operand size in a register. */
