/* x87 (D8-DF). Memory forms by ModRM.reg; register forms by reg and rm. EFLAGS are touched only by
 * FCOMI/FUCOMI (ZF PF CF, OF SF AF cleared) and read by FCMOVcc. The undocumented register aliases
 * (FSTP1, FXCH4, FCOM2...) are left out until the CPU oracle (M2) says what they do. */
